  "recipeCuisine": "France",
  "name": "Vegetable Stock",
  "text": "Vegetable Stock\n\nYield: 1.5 l\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nCooking time: 45 minutes\n\nIngredients\n\n300 g carrots (cut into rounds),\n\n2 leeks (white part, thinly sliced),\n\n100 g celery stalks (thinly sliced),\n\n50 g bulb of fennel (very thinly sliced),\n\n150 g shallots (thinly sliced),\n\n100 g onion (thinly sliced),\n\n2 cloves of garlic (unpeeled),\n\n1 bouquet garni,\n\n250 ml dry white wine,\n\n2 l water\n\n10 white peppercorns (crushed and wrapped in muslin),\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put all the ingredients except the peppercorns into a saucepan.\n\n2. Bring to the boil over a high heat, then reduce immediately to a simmer.\n\n3. Cook at a bare simmer for 45 minutes.\n\n4. After 35 minutes add the muslin wrapped peppercorns.\n\n5. Strain and cool as quickly as possible.",
  "recipeYield": "1.5 l",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
  "cookTime": "PT45M",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "300 g carrots (cut into rounds),",
